    "notes": "Corrective patch only. The current trash-bin dimensions are deliberately not changed here. Catalog, canonical state, behavior and automatic-depot identity are plastic-trash-bin. scene3d now dispatches that canonical type through the existing fixed-GLB normalization path and loads plastic_trash_bin.glb without converting the module back to a plant type. Browser regression exercises real drag/drop, waits for the GLB to finish loading into the real scene module, and confirms the rendered module is interactable through its context menu."
  },
